<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in the Treasure Valley, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value built for heavy new-construction volume to handleless German luxury for foothills luxury builds — backed by 23+ years of hands-on dealer support. We offer protected territory, line training, and the design and merchandising help your team needs to win Boise-area projects.</p>

